{"id":"n42172-1-8","stage":4,"title":"단란하다 · 和睦","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n42172-1-8-1","ko":"너는 회사 동료들과 사이가 어때?","zh":"你和公司的同事们关系怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동료들과","meaning":"同事，同僚","explanation":"동료：同事，同僚；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"동료","audio":"/audio/60cd6085b9cc16cf20e2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14802","senseId":"1","lemma":"동료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사이가","meaning":"关系","explanation":"사이：关系；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"4","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"60cd6085b9cc16cf","term":"동료","zh":"同事，同僚","audio":"/audio/60cd6085b9cc16cf20e2.mp3","entryId":"14802","definition":"在同一单位工作的人。","pronunciation":["동뇨"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"关系","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"相互结交的关系或结交后亲密的程度。","pronunciation":["사이"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/86a209cfca5e338262dd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n42172-1-8-2","ko":"우리 부서는 인원이 적어서 분위기도 단란하고 아주 좋아.","zh":"我们部门人数不多，氛围也很融洽，非常好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부서는","meaning":"部门","explanation":"부서：部门；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"부서","audio":"/audio/57bcfb6e119961a2aa23.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26317","senseId":"1","lemma":"부서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인원이","meaning":"人员","explanation":"인원：人员；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"인원","audio":"/audio/4db37806d287be242e3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70773","senseId":"1","lemma":"인원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"적어서","meaning":"少，小，欠缺","explanation":"적다：少，小，欠缺；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"적다","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62051","senseId":"1","lemma":"적다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분위기도","meaning":"气氛，氛围","explanation":"분위기：气氛，氛围；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"분위기","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65855","senseId":"1","lemma":"분위기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"단란하고","meaning":"和睦，温馨","explanation":"단란하다：和睦，温馨；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"단란하다","audio":"/audio/fa7e5e1b9bbc5d8d98b2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42172","senseId":"1","lemma":"단란하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"好，亲，和睦，美满","explanation":"좋다：好，亲，和睦，美满；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"16","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"57bcfb6e119961a2","term":"부서","zh":"部门","audio":"/audio/57bcfb6e119961a2aa23.mp3","entryId":"26317","definition":"公司、机关、组织中按照工作的性质分成的多个业务单位。","pronunciation":["부서"]},{"id":"4db37806d287be24","term":"인원","zh":"人员","audio":"/audio/4db37806d287be242e3e.mp3","entryId":"70773","definition":"组成聚会或团体的人；或指那些人的人数。","pronunciation":["이눤"]},{"id":"5f930febe6cd0f79","term":"적다","zh":"少，小，欠缺","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3","entryId":"62051","definition":"数、量或程度等达不到一定的标准。","pronunciation":["적ː따"]},{"id":"b0d7b29bb8fee646","term":"분위기","zh":"气氛，氛围","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3","entryId":"65855","definition":"在某个场合或场面获得的感受。","pronunciation":["부뉘기"]},{"id":"fa7e5e1b9bbc5d8d","term":"단란하다","zh":"和睦，温馨","audio":"/audio/fa7e5e1b9bbc5d8d98b2.mp3","entryId":"42172","definition":"家人或同组织成员间关系融洽和乐。","pronunciation":["달란하다"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，亲，和睦，美满","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"相互亲近、亲密。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/c39ce52b028004e0603c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.142,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=42172","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":149,"sequenceScore":2.9687,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你和公司的同事们关系怎么样？","我们部门人数不多，氛围也很融洽，非常好。","我怎么看都完全不明白这个的使用方法啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你和公司的同事们关系怎么样？","我们部门人数不多，氛围也很融洽，非常好。","我怎么看都完全不明白这个的使用方法啊。"],"answer":1}]}
